review_text_raw:
As previous reviews said, hacker fantasy extraordinaire.  If you like four or more of the following, this game is for you:

[list]
[*]Worming your way through logic/memory "puzzles";
[*]Good typing/keyboarding skills;
[*]Relaxing electronic beatz;
[*]Command Line Interface;
[*]Amusing .txt files;
[*]Lord Nikon/CrashOverride=ZeroCool/AcidBurn/PhantomPhreak/CerealKiller;
[*]Want to indulge your snooping fantasy without causing harm or loss to real people;
[*]Wished you still had rollerblades;
[/list]
